<title>USA: TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMERICA'S RED CLAY CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL SPRINGS, Florida 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$245,000 America's Red Clay Tennis Championship on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>1-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Steve Campbell (U.S.) 6-4 4-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>4-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Johan Van Herck</p>
<p>(Belgium) 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
